  "raw_text": "A guiding principle was articulated about how external transcripts and write-ups should enter the system: they must stay raw and uncurated. The stated rationale is that the value lies not in a pre-shaped or hand-edited artifact but in what the vivify pipeline itself extracts from unprocessed material. Curating a transcript before ingestion would pre-empt the emergent structure the pipeline is designed to surface, so raw input is treated as the more valuable feedstock.",
